[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 0.85,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Welcome back to Path Talks.",
    "char_start": 14,
    "char_end": 41,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 0.85,
    "end": 4.74,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Today, we're talking about trail construction, and I'm joined by Stefan Brandt, a trail builder with the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 42,
    "char_end": 165,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 4.74,
    "end": 6.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Stefan Brandt, thank you for being here.",
    "char_start": 166,
    "char_end": 206,
    "unit_id": "t0000.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0000.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 6.0,
    "end": 7.12,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Thank you, Katrin.",
    "char_start": 222,
    "char_end": 240,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 7.12,
    "end": 12.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "You're very welcome – road construction is something I've thought a lot about.",
    "char_start": 241,
    "char_end": 319,
    "unit_id": "t0001.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0001.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.0,
    "end": 14.2,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "This episode is brought to you by Strava.",
    "char_start": 334,
    "char_end": 375,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.2,
    "end": 15.86,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Strava is the home of athletes.",
    "char_start": 376,
    "char_end": 407,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 15.86,
    "end": 18.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Visit strava.com/podcast to get started.",
    "char_start": 408,
    "char_end": 448,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.0,
    "end": 21.04,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made that decision.",
    "char_start": 449,
    "char_end": 490,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 21.04,
    "end": 24.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 491,
    "char_end": 531,
    "unit_id": "t0002.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0002.s05"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.0,
    "end": 27.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "To be honest, the way you handle drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on every project.",
    "char_start": 547,
    "char_end": 657,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 27.0,
    "end": 28.58,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 658,
    "char_end": 716,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.58,
    "end": 30.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 717,
    "char_end": 769,
    "unit_id": "t0003.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0003.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 32.17,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 784,
    "char_end": 818,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.17,
    "end": 36.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core issue that really matters in this question?",
    "char_start": 819,
    "char_end": 879,
    "unit_id": "t0004.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0004.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.0,
    "end": 39.63,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, see – a common mistake that new path builders make is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 895,
    "char_end": 987,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 39.63,
    "end": 42.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 988,
    "char_end": 1048,
    "unit_id": "t0005.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0005.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.0,
    "end": 44.44,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 1063,
    "char_end": 1100,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.44,
    "end": 48.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1101,
    "char_end": 1155,
    "unit_id": "t0006.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0006.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.0,
    "end": 48.27,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1171,
    "char_end": 1181,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.27,
    "end": 50.37,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before any ground is broken.",
    "char_start": 1182,
    "char_end": 1260,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 50.37,
    "end": 52.01,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use RockShox products.",
    "char_start": 1261,
    "char_end": 1322,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.01,
    "end": 54.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The frame is important because it tells you what trade-offs you're making.",
    "char_start": 1323,
    "char_end": 1397,
    "unit_id": "t0007.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0007.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 54.0,
    "end": 60.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 1412,
    "char_end": 1434,
    "unit_id": "t0008.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0008.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 60.0,
    "end": 66.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And when teams integrate Spoke & Wrench into this process, the trade-offs become clear. If you ignore these trade-offs, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 1450,
    "char_end": 1639,
    "unit_id": "t0009.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0009.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 66.0,
    "end": 68.55,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 1654,
    "char_end": 1694,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 68.55,
    "end": 72.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 1695,
    "char_end": 1749,
    "unit_id": "t0010.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0010.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.0,
    "end": 72.36,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Certainly.",
    "char_start": 1765,
    "char_end": 1775,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 72.36,
    "end": 73.64,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Bankings on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 1776,
    "char_end": 1812,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 73.64,
    "end": 75.46,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The shortcut is the breakthrough in the third year.",
    "char_start": 1813,
    "char_end": 1864,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 75.46,
    "end": 78.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 1865,
    "char_end": 1936,
    "unit_id": "t0011.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0011.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 78.0,
    "end": 79.71,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "This is a useful framework.",
    "char_start": 1951,
    "char_end": 1978,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 79.71,
    "end": 84.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core issue or the most important aspect of the question?",
    "char_start": 1979,
    "char_end": 2047,
    "unit_id": "t0012.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0012.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 84.0,
    "end": 86.39,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, look – the team structure is more important than people often realize.",
    "char_start": 2063,
    "char_end": 2138,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 86.39,
    "end": 88.34,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use the Spoke & Wrench model.",
    "char_start": 2139,
    "char_end": 2200,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.34,
    "end": 90.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2201,
    "char_end": 2253,
    "unit_id": "t0013.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0013.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 90.0,
    "end": 91.88,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the error mode look like?",
    "char_start": 2268,
    "char_end": 2303,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 91.88,
    "end": 96.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the structural perspective that most listeners do not have access to?",
    "char_start": 2304,
    "char_end": 2381,
    "unit_id": "t0014.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0014.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 96.0,
    "end": 97.99,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the perspective that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 2397,
    "char_end": 2459,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 97.99,
    "end": 100.27,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have changed my opinion about machine-built versus hand-built trails.",
    "char_start": 2460,
    "char_end": 2531,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 100.27,
    "end": 102.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 2532,
    "char_end": 2586,
    "unit_id": "t0015.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0015.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.0,
    "end": 108.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me more about it.",
    "char_start": 2601,
    "char_end": 2623,
    "unit_id": "t0016.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0016.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 108.0,
    "end": 114.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And when teams integrate the Cascadia Alliance into this process, the trade-offs become clear. If you ignore these trade-offs, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 2639,
    "char_end": 2835,
    "unit_id": "t0017.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0017.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 114.0,
    "end": 120.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "We'll be right back after a short commercial break.",
    "char_start": 2850,
    "char_end": 2901,
    "unit_id": "t0018.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0018.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 120.0,
    "end": 121.48,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Today's episode is brought to you by Stripe.",
    "char_start": 2914,
    "char_end": 2958,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.48,
    "end": 124.58,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Stripe makes payments easy, whether you're running a marketplace or a subscription business.",
    "char_start": 2959,
    "char_end": 3051,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.58,
    "end": 126.0,
    "speaker_label": "SPEAKER_02",
    "text": "Visit stripe.com/podcast for a free trial.",
    "char_start": 3052,
    "char_end": 3094,
    "unit_id": "t0019.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0019.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 126.0,
    "end": 127.32,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Welcome back to the show.",
    "char_start": 3109,
    "char_end": 3134,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 127.32,
    "end": 129.16,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the error mode look like?",
    "char_start": 3135,
    "char_end": 3170,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 129.16,
    "end": 132.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where do soil erosion and road construction intersect?",
    "char_start": 3171,
    "char_end": 3225,
    "unit_id": "t0020.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0020.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.0,
    "end": 132.51,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "That's my perspective.",
    "char_start": 3241,
    "char_end": 3263,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 132.51,
    "end": 134.85,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Drainage is the design decision that has the biggest impact on performance, regardless of the route.",
    "char_start": 3264,
    "char_end": 3364,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.85,
    "end": 136.13,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
    "char_start": 3365,
    "char_end": 3420,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 136.13,
    "end": 138.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 3421,
    "char_end": 3501,
    "unit_id": "t0021.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0021.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 138.0,
    "end": 141.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Tell me about how you made the decision.",
    "char_start": 3516,
    "char_end": 3556,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 141.0,
    "end": 144.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 3557,
    "char_end": 3597,
    "unit_id": "t0022.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0022.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 144.0,
    "end": 147.63,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, see – a common mistake that new path builders make is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 3613,
    "char_end": 3705,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 147.63,
    "end": 150.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 3706,
    "char_end": 3766,
    "unit_id": "t0023.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0023.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 150.0,
    "end": 151.58,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Challenge my existing beliefs.",
    "char_start": 3781,
    "char_end": 3811,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 151.58,
    "end": 156.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What did you used to believe about this, and how have your views changed since then?",
    "char_start": 3812,
    "char_end": 3896,
    "unit_id": "t0024.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0024.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 156.0,
    "end": 157.49,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the approach that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 3912,
    "char_end": 3971,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 157.49,
    "end": 159.4,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Discussions about land management must take place before any digging begins.",
    "char_start": 3972,
    "char_end": 4048,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 159.4,
    "end": 160.69,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
    "char_start": 4049,
    "char_end": 4100,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 160.69,
    "end": 162.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4101,
    "char_end": 4153,
    "unit_id": "t0025.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0025.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 162.0,
    "end": 168.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "That fits.\nThat works.\nThat's perfect.\nThat's right.\nThat's a good fit.",
    "char_start": 4168,
    "char_end": 4239,
    "unit_id": "t0026.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0026.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 168.0,
    "end": 171.62,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the Cascadia Alliance level, the error mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "char_start": 4255,
    "char_end": 4363,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 171.62,
    "end": 174.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
    "char_start": 4364,
    "char_end": 4435,
    "unit_id": "t0027.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0027.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 174.0,
    "end": 177.03,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the guiding principle you always come back to?",
    "char_start": 4450,
    "char_end": 4504,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 177.03,
    "end": 180.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the core of the question that really matters?",
    "char_start": 4505,
    "char_end": 4558,
    "unit_id": "t0028.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0028.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 180.0,
    "end": 182.18,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "It all boils down to this: curbs on slopes are not optional.",
    "char_start": 4574,
    "char_end": 4634,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 182.18,
    "end": 184.04,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The shortcut is the breakthrough in the third year.",
    "char_start": 4635,
    "char_end": 4686,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 184.04,
    "end": 186.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I have observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 4687,
    "char_end": 4741,
    "unit_id": "t0029.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0029.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 186.0,
    "end": 188.29,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 4756,
    "char_end": 4793,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 188.29,
    "end": 192.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of road construction?",
    "char_start": 4794,
    "char_end": 4854,
    "unit_id": "t0030.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0030.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 192.0,
    "end": 193.48,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Let me share with you the framework that I truly believe in.",
    "char_start": 4870,
    "char_end": 4930,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 193.48,
    "end": 195.19,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The underlying structure is more important than people often realize.",
    "char_start": 4931,
    "char_end": 5000,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 195.19,
    "end": 196.72,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that utilize the Cascadia Alliance.",
    "char_start": 5001,
    "char_end": 5063,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 196.72,
    "end": 198.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
    "char_start": 5064,
    "char_end": 5116,
    "unit_id": "t0031.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0031.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 198.0,
    "end": 200.92,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 5131,
    "char_end": 5168,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 200.92,
    "end": 204.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "How does Shimano fit into this picture?",
    "char_start": 5169,
    "char_end": 5208,
    "unit_id": "t0032.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0032.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 204.0,
    "end": 207.43,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Yes, look – I've changed my opinion about machine-built versus hand-built roads.",
    "char_start": 5224,
    "char_end": 5304,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 207.43,
    "end": 210.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5305,
    "char_end": 5365,
    "unit_id": "t0033.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0033.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 210.0,
    "end": 216.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Where does it stop working?",
    "char_start": 5380,
    "char_end": 5407,
    "unit_id": "t0034.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0034.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 216.0,
    "end": 219.64,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Outside of the tools available at the RockShox level, the error mode is more difficult to identify.",
    "char_start": 5423,
    "char_end": 5522,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 219.64,
    "end": 222.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Once you understand that, the remaining decisions become easier.",
    "char_start": 5523,
    "char_end": 5587,
    "unit_id": "t0035.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0035.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 222.0,
    "end": 228.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Let's change the subject – I would like to dedicate the next section to land management.",
    "char_start": 5602,
    "char_end": 5690,
    "unit_id": "t0036.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0036.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 228.0,
    "end": 234.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the considerations surrounding land management permeate everything we've discussed.",
    "char_start": 5706,
    "char_end": 5848,
    "unit_id": "t0037.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0037.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 234.0,
    "end": 236.02,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "I would like to explore this further.",
    "char_start": 5863,
    "char_end": 5900,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 236.02,
    "end": 240.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners are unable to grasp?",
    "char_start": 5901,
    "char_end": 5974,
    "unit_id": "t0038.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0038.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 240.0,
    "end": 242.94,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Ultimately, the suspension setup is the design choice that has the biggest impact on performance, regardless of the riding style.",
    "char_start": 5990,
    "char_end": 6119,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 242.94,
    "end": 243.97,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
    "char_start": 6120,
    "char_end": 6165,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 243.97,
    "end": 246.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
    "char_start": 6166,
    "char_end": 6255,
    "unit_id": "t0039.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0039.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.0,
    "end": 248.29,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
    "char_start": 6270,
    "char_end": 6307,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.29,
    "end": 252.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of road construction?",
    "char_start": 6308,
    "char_end": 6368,
    "unit_id": "t0040.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0040.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 252.0,
    "end": 255.06,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "To be honest, the most common mistake made by new path builders is digging with too much of a slope.",
    "char_start": 6384,
    "char_end": 6484,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 255.06,
    "end": 258.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The framework is important because it tells you what considerations you are taking into account.",
    "char_start": 6485,
    "char_end": 6581,
    "unit_id": "t0041.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0041.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 258.0,
    "end": 264.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Before we wrap up, what's one thing that listeners can try out this week?",
    "char_start": 6596,
    "char_end": 6669,
    "unit_id": "t0042.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0042.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.0,
    "end": 268.53,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
    "char_start": 6685,
    "char_end": 6753,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 268.53,
    "end": 270.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "The rest is iteration.",
    "char_start": 6754,
    "char_end": 6776,
    "unit_id": "t0043.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0043.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 270.0,
    "end": 272.28,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
    "char_start": 6791,
    "char_end": 6846,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.28,
    "end": 275.3,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Linear is the issue tracker, built for speed – designed for keyboard use.",
    "char_start": 6847,
    "char_end": 6920,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s02"
  },
  {
    "start": 275.3,
    "end": 276.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Visit linear.com.",
    "char_start": 6921,
    "char_end": 6938,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s03"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.0,
    "end": 282.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Stefan Brandt, thank you for the conversation.",
    "char_start": 6939,
    "char_end": 6985,
    "unit_id": "t0044.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0044.s04"
  },
  {
    "start": 282.0,
    "end": 288.0,
    "speaker_label": "Stefan Brandt",
    "text": "Thank you, Katrin.",
    "char_start": 7001,
    "char_end": 7019,
    "unit_id": "t0045.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0045.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 288.0,
    "end": 292.65,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "That's all for today's episode of \"Path Conversations.\"",
    "char_start": 7034,
    "char_end": 7089,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s01"
  },
  {
    "start": 292.65,
    "end": 294.0,
    "speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
    "text": "Until next time.",
    "char_start": 7090,
    "char_end": 7106,
    "unit_id": "t0046.u01",
    "sent_id": "t0046.s02"
  }
]
